    "answer": {
      "short": "$452\\text{ m}^2$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}r&=12\\text{ m}\\\\A&=\\pi r^2\\\\A&=\\pi\\times12^2\\\\A&=144\\pi\\text{ m}^2\\\\A&\\approx452\\text{ m}^2\\end{align*}$$",
